config PINCTRL_AX630C
	bool "Axera AX630C (AX620E) pin controller"
	depends on ARM64 || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on OF
	select GENERIC_PINCTRL_GROUPS
	select GENERIC_PINMUX_FUNCTIONS
	select GENERIC_PINCONF
	select MFD_SYSCON
	help
	  Pin multiplexing and pin configuration for the Axera AX630C and the
	  rest of the AX620E family: 111 pads across two register windows, with
	  a 3-bit function select and per-pad bias, drive-strength and schmitt
	  configuration.

	  Say Y if you are building a kernel for an AX620E-family SoC. There is
	  no module option: pads must be muxed before the peripherals that use
	  them probe.
